ApplyPilot attribution
----------------------

TI-AAA is an internship-focused adaptation informed by ApplyPilot:

  https://github.com/Pickle-Pixel/ApplyPilot

ApplyPilot was created by Pickle-Pixel and is distributed under the GNU
Affero General Public License, version 3. TI-AAA retains the same license.
The original project established the open-source pipeline concept and
application workflow patterns that inspired TI-AAA, including staged SQLite
tracking and Claude Code / Playwright browser-worker orchestration.

TI-AAA is a separate project. It replaces broad job-board discovery with
polling of explicitly configured community GitHub repositories and adds a
persistent internship tracker and local analytics dashboard.

Internship data sources
-----------------------

At runtime, TI-AAA can read public listing documents from:

  https://github.com/sndsh404/summer-2027-internships
  https://github.com/vanshb03/Summer2027-Internships
  https://github.com/SimplifyJobs/Summer2026-Internships

Those repositories, their names, and their listing content belong to their
respective maintainers and contributors. TI-AAA does not redistribute their
listing databases in its source distribution and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by those maintainers.
